was observed at 3007 cm−1. The NH2 bending vibrations was shown at 1593 cm−1. In the spectrum of O-CSPX, an
extra peak appeared at 1667 cm−1, which is the absorption peak of the stretching vibrations of C=O. The absorption peak of pyridyl appeared at 1525 cm−1, and the C=C was observed at 1730 cm−1. The band at 1409 cm−1 and

